      "content": "but that's just what people say to feel better about themselves. like, they call it \"temporary\" because if they admitted it's permanent, they'd have to face how much it actually sucks. if someone is just in constant, unbearable pain for no reason, isn't choosing peace more logical than just suffering forever?",
